WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:37.250
Getting pulled down by gravity
and falling is really scary!

00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:40.000
And it happened in the middle
of a mobile suit battle.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:44.630
Though, I wonder if
we could call it a real fight.

00:01:44.630 --> 00:01:47.180
Atmospheric entry was new
for our enemies, too.

00:01:47.180 --> 00:01:48.980
And they were all kinda scared of it.

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:50.930
Ple, don't cry!

00:01:50.930 --> 00:01:52.440
Look! We're on Earth!

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:59.530
SIBLING LOVE BLOOMS IN THE SOUTHERN SEAS

00:02:15.890 --> 00:02:18.330
The Federation forces didn't
offer much resistance.

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:21.630
To think that we could
seize Dakar so easily.

00:02:21.630 --> 00:02:24.630
Sending the 26th Squadron
as backup to S Block!

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:26.520
- Good!
- Yes, sir!

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:29.510
The Federation assembly is in our hands!

00:02:29.510 --> 00:02:34.140
Now, we just need to gather up any former
Titans forces before Lady Haman arrives...

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:36.480
...and the Earth will be ours.

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:54.050
Detaching ballute.

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:57.340
Three, two, one!

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:04.210
All right, correct our attitude.

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:07.390
Prepare for hover flight and
head for rendezvous point.

00:03:14.030 --> 00:03:17.390
Checking attitude!
360-degree visual observation!

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:19.860
Move bridge to observation position!

00:03:21.290 --> 00:03:24.530
- Wow, oceans and land!
- It's even more beautiful than a colony!

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:27.780
So we're in Africa.

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:32.170
Confirm our landing point and
gather all the mobile suits.

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:41.720
Yee-haw! Finally here!

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:46.550
It's just like the photographs.
This is amazing!

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:51.680
Ple! Ple! Can you hear me?!

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:53.140
Everyone all right?

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:56.260
All units, stay put until the
Argama comes to pick you up.

00:03:56.260 --> 00:03:58.650
Prepare the launch for deployment.

00:03:58.650 --> 00:04:02.650
After this, the Argama will never
rise to space again.

00:04:18.140 --> 00:04:23.130
The Argama's landing point is
about 400 km south of Dakar.

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:26.040
We can assume that the enemy
is converging at Dakar.

00:04:26.210 --> 00:04:27.300
Right.

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:29.090
We've received a coded
message from Karaba!

00:04:29.090 --> 00:04:30.670
- Read it!
- Yes, sir!

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:33.140
Dakar has been seized by Neo Zeon!

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:34.940
Neo Zeon?

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:38.890
Axis has joined together
with former Zeon forces.

00:04:38.890 --> 00:04:40.310
- And?
- Yes, sir!

00:04:40.310 --> 00:04:44.860
The Argama's mobile suit squad
is ordered to head north to Dakar!

00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:49.780
They want us to enter an area
where the Axis fleet is gathering?

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:02.910
Ein and Beats, you can go back.
One Capule should be enough for now.

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:05.170
- But...!
- We're just checking their strength.

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:08.210
Th-Then, we'll go ahead to base.

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:09.720
All right.

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:15.390
Right, let's go back to the island.

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:16.430
Is that okay?

00:05:16.430 --> 00:05:18.730
There's nothing else we can do!

00:05:18.730 --> 00:05:20.900
Take that, Argama!

00:05:25.910 --> 00:05:27.690
What was that?!

00:05:27.690 --> 00:05:29.160
Roux!

00:05:31.110 --> 00:05:33.280
- Where's the Double Zeta?
- Judau!

00:05:33.280 --> 00:05:34.910
We're not in space right now!

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:36.450
I-I see!

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:37.910
Judau, stand by in the Double Zeta!

00:05:37.910 --> 00:05:39.160
Why?!

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:42.170
The enemy's behaving strangely.
I want the Zeta to check it out first.

00:05:52.590 --> 00:05:57.470
Hmph, don't think you can take
a localized mobile suit lightly!

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:13.650
I keep getting further and
further from Leina!

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:15.780
I said our mission comes first.

00:06:15.780 --> 00:06:17.320
We're being signaled by a fishing boat.

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:18.200
What?

00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:22.890
Sir. It keeps repeating that they'll show us
a "safe location" for 5,000 gillas.

00:06:22.890 --> 00:06:25.580
So someone's trying to do
business with a warship.

00:06:25.580 --> 00:06:28.560
Instead of hiding, we should just
send out all our mobile suits!

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:31.540
Even so, we can't hang around
in the middle of the ocean.

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:33.770
That guy's just gonna come back!

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:36.300
And it's your job to stop
him if he does!

00:06:36.300 --> 00:06:40.190
- What do you think, sir?
- Locals must know better about their own area.

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:44.120
They wanna do business!

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:46.100
Taman, go get the money!

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:47.530
Okay!

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:49.980
Judau?!

00:06:49.980 --> 00:06:52.940
W-What are you doing...
in a place like this!

00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:55.190
I came to check up on
that Elpeo Ple girl.

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:56.190
What are you carrying?

00:06:56.360 --> 00:07:00.030
I... I thought I'd
bring Ple some stuff.

00:07:00.030 --> 00:07:01.070
Ple!

00:07:01.070 --> 00:07:03.490
Ow... why didn't it open?

00:07:03.490 --> 00:07:04.910
'Cause she's a prisoner.

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:09.320
That, and Captain Bright told me to
not let you in by yourself.

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:10.790
- Ple!
- Judau!

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:13.040
Look at you! You're doing pretty good!

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:16.050
My body is heavy,
and I don't feel good.

00:07:16.050 --> 00:07:17.470
I mean, I can't even take a bath!

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:21.360
Don't make us sound so bad!
You've got a shower!

00:07:21.360 --> 00:07:23.970
I can't swim in a shower!
And there's no bath stuff!

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:25.890
Fine, I'll bring you some!

00:07:25.890 --> 00:07:26.890
Judau!

00:07:26.890 --> 00:07:30.270
Yeah. Ple, don't be too
much trouble, okay?

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:31.440
Where are you going?

00:07:31.440 --> 00:07:33.820
He's not really going anywhere.

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:37.240
I'm going with Beecha to hand some
money over to a fishing boat.

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:39.280
- Elle, look after her.
- Judau!

00:07:39.280 --> 00:07:41.460
Goodbye, Ple.

00:07:45.090 --> 00:07:46.410
Hey, where's the money?

00:07:46.410 --> 00:07:48.290
Yeah, this is it.

00:07:48.290 --> 00:07:51.630
Hey, w-what are you doing?!

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:53.890
Man, you Spacenoids are super weak!

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:57.010
You take our money and
that's all you have to say?!

00:07:57.650 --> 00:08:00.050
The war pretty much ruined
our fishing business.

00:08:00.050 --> 00:08:02.930
So what's wrong with taking
money from warships instead?!

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:04.760
Guide us as you promised!

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:06.810
Just follow the boat in front.

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:14.660
Make sure you keep up!

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:21.040
Why did you decide to help me?

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:23.330
You jumped ship to get
away from the war?

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:25.450
I know how you feel.

00:08:25.450 --> 00:08:28.370
Here in Africa, the Zeon,
the Federation, the Titans...

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:30.840
They never get sick of
fighting for territory.

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:33.540
So I'm gonna use the war to get ahead.

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:35.640
That's pretty impressive.

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:39.550
It's only going to get worse.

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:41.420
Y-You're kidding.

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:44.520
You're lucky that your first time
at sea is in the middle of a storm!

00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:53.020
Hey, where's Judau?
Wasn't he with you guys?

00:08:53.020 --> 00:08:54.400
- Judau?
- Beats me.

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:56.770
But he said he was going
to join you, Beecha.

00:08:56.770 --> 00:08:59.610
I know! I bet he's in Ple's room again!

00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:00.870
Judau?

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:03.320
He didn't come here?

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:05.660
Judau isn't on this ship anymore.

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:08.490
What? Don't make up things like that.

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:10.500
But I can feel it.

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:13.620
Judau is going further
and further away.

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:16.710
Wow, can all Newtypes do that?

00:09:16.710 --> 00:09:18.590
I don't know about that.

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:20.130
But I can feel it.

00:09:20.130 --> 00:09:21.510
- Come with me.
- What is it?!

00:09:21.730 --> 00:09:25.550
Guide me! You know
where Judau is, right?

00:09:25.550 --> 00:09:28.600
Okay! I can find Judau in a jiffy!

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:36.740
Anu, I'm home!

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:38.860
Welcome back, Big Brother!

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:40.030
Who's that?

00:09:40.030 --> 00:09:41.610
Sorry to bother you.

00:09:41.610 --> 00:09:44.680
A younger sister? She looks
about the same age as Leina.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:47.280
I promised that I'd
take him to the mainland.

00:09:47.280 --> 00:09:48.950
Are you going to do
something dangerous again?

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:51.430
Please, don't do any
more dangerous things.

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:54.680
Anu, who do you think pays for
all the food that you eat?!

00:09:54.680 --> 00:09:56.710
It's all right if we're poor!

00:09:56.710 --> 00:09:59.300
I don't want anything
to do with the war!

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:01.300
Um... am I causing trouble?

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:04.430
It's all right!
She's just being selfish!

00:10:04.430 --> 00:10:06.300
Oh... I'm sorry.

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:08.360
Please, come sit down over here.

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:10.060
Thanks.

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:11.520
I'm Judau.

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:14.440
Please, call me Anu.

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:20.860
They may not be able to
find us in this cove.

00:10:20.860 --> 00:10:23.650
Thank the ship that
guided us here, Torres.

00:10:23.650 --> 00:10:25.900
Ple, where is Judau?

00:10:25.900 --> 00:10:27.240
I can't tell from here!

00:10:27.490 --> 00:10:30.120
I'm the one who's going.
You need to tell me right here!

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:32.220
Which direction?

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:35.580
Umm... Judau is... umm...

00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:37.250
Where did you come from?

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:39.040
Judau is still on this ship!

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:40.500
You lied to me!

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:42.830
You said that Judau left the Argama!

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:44.130
This girl...!

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:45.720
Ple!

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:46.800
Ple!

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:50.970
Who took the Core Fighter...?!

00:10:52.740 --> 00:10:54.520
Judau...

00:10:54.870 --> 00:10:57.270
Why is the hatch open?!

00:11:10.170 --> 00:11:12.660
So your little sister is in Dakar?

00:11:12.660 --> 00:11:16.250
Yeah. Is there any way I
can get to the coastline?

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:17.710
Here you go, Mr. Judau.

00:11:17.710 --> 00:11:19.470
S-Sorry, thanks.

00:11:22.140 --> 00:11:25.010
You're about the same age as Leina.

00:11:26.270 --> 00:11:28.130
Taman! We got a new job!

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:28.970
We're doing it?

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:32.720
In this wind, they're all scared,
and they say they'll double the pay!

00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:34.260
Really?

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:35.930
With only this much wind?

00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:38.480
I guess it's because they all
grew up in outer space!

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:40.160
Big Brother! Stop!

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:42.060
Stop getting involved with the war!

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:43.770
Getting involved?

00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:44.860
Yes...

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:47.990
Recently, giant robots were
brought to this island...

00:11:47.990 --> 00:11:50.660
And everyone, including my brother,
was trained to pilot them.

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:52.240
Pilot training?!

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:55.790
Does he really want money
so badly that he'd kill for it?

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:58.660
Where's he going? Maybe I can stop him.

00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:01.620
- C-Could you?
- I'll try, at least!

00:12:15.990 --> 00:12:19.100
Damn that Ple! It's all
because of this rain!

00:12:19.100 --> 00:12:20.940
Iino, let's split up!

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:22.600
Wait, split up?

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:25.650
We'll meet back at this point
in 15 minutes. Set your gyro!

00:12:25.650 --> 00:12:27.200
Got it!

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:30.740
It's that cave!

00:12:30.740 --> 00:12:32.450
Got it! Anu, you go back home!

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:33.740
But...

00:12:33.740 --> 00:12:36.330
You have to protect the money
that's sitting in your hut, Anu!

00:12:36.330 --> 00:12:37.740
B-But...

00:12:50.110 --> 00:12:55.850
We lured the Argama into this cove, and they
have no idea we're right under their noses.

00:12:55.850 --> 00:13:00.520
But I don't like how you people look down on
us Spacenoids, as if we can't handle the sea.

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:01.850
We never said that...

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:04.060
You guys demanded double pay!

00:13:04.060 --> 00:13:04.850
But--

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:07.920
Taman! Earn your money by using
the Capule to attack the Argama!

00:13:07.920 --> 00:13:09.440
U-Understood!

00:13:09.440 --> 00:13:10.740
Is that okay?!

00:13:10.740 --> 00:13:12.700
I gotta earn my money!

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:14.070
Get to it!

00:13:14.070 --> 00:13:18.990
Commander! Are you sure we should
let them use the new model from Axis?

00:13:18.990 --> 00:13:25.220
Who'd trust an aquatic mobile suit made
by people who've never seen an ocean?

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:28.390
It may be an older model,
but the Zaku has proven itself.

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:31.600
- Taman!
- Judau?!

00:13:31.600 --> 00:13:33.680
- Why are you here?!
- What do you mean why?!

00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:35.590
Look who's talking!
You're betraying the Argama!

00:13:35.590 --> 00:13:38.350
Why do you care about a
ship that you abandoned?

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:40.390
You think you can do whatever you want
in the name of survival?

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:42.230
Shut up!

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:52.330
This is the only thing I can do, Judau.

00:13:53.550 --> 00:13:55.870
All units, forward!

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:09.460
I heard Judau cry out just now...!

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:11.050
Judau, where are you?

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:13.800
Big Brother... Big Brother....

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:16.130
Judau! Judau!

00:14:16.130 --> 00:14:17.090
Leina...

00:14:17.090 --> 00:14:18.850
Mr. Judau!

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:20.930
I'm fine... Where's Taman?

00:14:20.930 --> 00:14:23.230
He climbed into that machine.

00:14:23.230 --> 00:14:25.230
If I don't do something,
they're gonna sink the Argama.

00:14:25.230 --> 00:14:26.270
Argama?

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:27.810
The ship I came here on.

00:14:27.810 --> 00:14:29.650
Miss Anu, I'm borrowing
one of your boats.

00:14:29.650 --> 00:14:32.860
You can't! Someone with no experience
can't handle these waters right now.

00:14:32.860 --> 00:14:35.350
So you want Taman to murder people?

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:37.460
He might die too, you know!

00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:44.500
B-But... if you go out to sea now,
Mr. Judau, you might get killed!

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:47.500
I won't die that easily...
and neither will Taman.

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:49.630
Then, I won't, either!

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:53.170
A Core Fighter?!

00:14:55.400 --> 00:14:58.480
P-Ple?! Why?!

00:15:00.110 --> 00:15:01.900
Found you!

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:03.720
Ple!

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:05.270
You get away from him!

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:06.520
How did you get here?

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:08.230
You called me here, Judau.

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:09.100
Called you?

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:12.890
Yeah! You told me to come,
so here I am.

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:15.530
I see... Thanks, Ple!

00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:18.650
Taman is sure to come back,
so don't worry.

00:15:18.650 --> 00:15:20.410
What are you doing?!

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:22.990
Mr. Judau... please take
care of my brother.

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:24.750
I gotcha!

00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:27.000
Judau...

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:33.290
You left me so you could hang
around with other girls, didn't you!

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:37.100
That's not true! You know what kind
of a situation we're in right now!

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:46.520
Capule, you're getting too far ahead!

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:50.400
Oh, sorry... this thing's
fast underwater.

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:55.650
Maintain your depth!

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:58.740
We'll sink the Argama before
it can launch its mobile suits!

00:16:03.170 --> 00:16:05.870
- I couldn't find her.
- I couldn't either. Where--

00:16:05.870 --> 00:16:07.880
There she is!

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:12.330
Ple! Where are you going?!
Weren't you looking for Judau?!

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:13.880
She found me!

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:16.000
You're in the Core Fighter, Judau?

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:17.630
With Ple!

00:16:17.630 --> 00:16:20.050
Why did you leave the
Argama undefended?!

00:16:20.050 --> 00:16:20.760
What do you mean!?

00:16:20.760 --> 00:16:24.260
Mobile suits are approaching
the Argama from underwater!

00:16:24.260 --> 00:16:25.650
What?!

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:29.270
Roger! Iino and I will return to
the Argama in the Core Fighter!

00:16:29.270 --> 00:16:32.490
Judau, hold back the
mobile suits with the Double Zeta!

00:16:33.370 --> 00:16:35.280
- It's okay!
- Roger!

00:16:54.020 --> 00:16:56.000
- Then...
- We'll count on you, Judau.

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:57.850
And I'll count on you guys.

00:16:58.350 --> 00:17:00.090
All right, time to dive in.

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:02.130
Have you ever dived before?

00:17:02.130 --> 00:17:03.560
Of course I haven't.

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:11.390
Will it be okay?

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:14.400
This was built to withstand
point-blank explosions!

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:16.910
It can handle a water pressure of 200 or 300.

00:17:19.920 --> 00:17:22.950
- What was that? I can't hear you!
- What's wrong?!

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:25.970
Elle and Iino are trying to call in,
but the Minovsky particles are...

00:17:25.970 --> 00:17:29.500
They're going to attack from underwater,
so hurry up and escape!

00:17:32.970 --> 00:17:35.790
After we launch this SUBROC barrage,

00:17:35.790 --> 00:17:38.640
we'll surface and finish them off.

00:17:40.650 --> 00:17:42.560
I won't let that happen!

00:17:44.360 --> 00:17:45.930
A mobile suit from the Argama!

00:17:45.930 --> 00:17:47.520
Commander! The Argama!

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:52.320
Fire! Fire! Don't let
the Argama lift off!

00:17:54.410 --> 00:17:56.100
Thrust is weak!

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:57.740
We're at maximum output!

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:07.540
I'm not going to let the
likes of you sink the Argama!

00:18:18.100 --> 00:18:21.000
I don't want to fight anyone
who isn't a regular pilot.

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:23.200
The regular pilots are our only enemies!

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:26.270
What? The Double Zeta is hesitating?

00:18:26.940 --> 00:18:29.980
So this is the Argama's
main mobile suit?!

00:18:31.060 --> 00:18:32.860
Stop it, Taman!!

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:36.150
All right! Concentrate fire!

00:18:39.080 --> 00:18:42.740
Heh, if only size matters,
then I have the advantage!

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:46.990
Taman! Don't put your life on
the line for money! Stop it!

00:18:46.990 --> 00:18:49.250
Sink, you big lug!

00:18:52.760 --> 00:18:56.660
Taman! Judau is telling you to stop!

00:18:56.660 --> 00:18:58.420
W-What?

00:18:58.420 --> 00:19:00.800
Sink already, mobile suit!

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:02.210
Fine!

00:19:08.190 --> 00:19:11.140
I... I don't want to die!

00:19:11.140 --> 00:19:14.690
Where are you going?! I won't let you
desert in the face of the enemy!

00:19:16.660 --> 00:19:18.190
What?!

00:19:19.160 --> 00:19:22.400
That's how the Zeon do things!
You fishermen, pull back!

00:19:22.400 --> 00:19:24.320
That's enough talk from you!

00:19:24.320 --> 00:19:26.740
What kind of soldiers use civilians
to do their dirty work?!

00:19:30.070 --> 00:19:32.790
How dare you kill Ein! Take this!

00:19:41.890 --> 00:19:44.260
Ein! Beats!

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:53.720
That's no pilot. That's a kid!

00:19:53.720 --> 00:19:56.240
Taman! The Zakus are all gone!

00:19:56.240 --> 00:20:00.980
If you weren't here, we'd have made
enough money to last four or five years!

00:20:08.710 --> 00:20:10.770
I'm caught!

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:13.200
Can you hear me, Taman?! This is Judau!

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:15.450
J-Judau?! That same Judau?!

00:20:15.450 --> 00:20:19.550
It was one of your people in the Zaku
your employer shot down, right?!

00:20:19.550 --> 00:20:23.820
J-Judau... you were piloting
that mobile suit?!

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:26.340
Do you think any of this
makes your sister Anu happy?

00:20:26.340 --> 00:20:31.440
Do you really think it's okay to take such
crazy risks just because times are tough?

00:20:31.440 --> 00:20:35.600
Who's going to be crying after
you get yourself killed, Taman?!

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:37.680
Who's going to be sad?!

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:39.980
Have you ever thought
about that, Taman?!

00:20:39.980 --> 00:20:43.730
D-Damn you... You're
a mobile suit pilot, yet you--

00:20:43.960 --> 00:20:47.380
I'm not doing this because I like it!

00:20:47.380 --> 00:20:51.580
Fighting sucks, man! Don't you
understand after seeing all this?!

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:54.620
Judau...

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:57.460
You're like this because
you depend on others!

00:20:57.460 --> 00:21:00.450
If you do everything in your
power to rely on yourself,

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:03.380
other people won't be able to use you!

00:21:03.380 --> 00:21:07.270
So instead of me using them...
they were using me?

00:21:07.270 --> 00:21:11.220
ME? That's not possible!

00:21:13.030 --> 00:21:16.060
That can't be! No way!

00:21:18.320 --> 00:21:19.450
Taman!

00:21:19.450 --> 00:21:21.690
It's okay, Judau.

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:24.980
It's back!

00:21:24.980 --> 00:21:26.530
Is that Taman's Capule?

00:21:26.960 --> 00:21:30.580
Out of the way! Out of the way!
Get away from there!

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:32.150
I'm going to collapse that cave!

00:21:32.380 --> 00:21:34.510
- What's wrong?
- Taman!

00:21:34.510 --> 00:21:37.280
This island doesn't need any robots!

00:21:37.280 --> 00:21:38.920
No robots!

00:21:53.150 --> 00:21:54.680
He did it!

00:21:54.680 --> 00:21:56.310
Yeah.

00:22:04.790 --> 00:22:08.190
Big Brother! Big Brother!

00:22:08.190 --> 00:22:10.780
Did you get hurt?
Are you all right?

00:22:11.750 --> 00:22:15.790
I won't get hurt doing something
this petty! I'm fine!

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:51.770
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:58.990
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:03.490
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:09.790
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:16.880
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:21.300
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:23.680
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:33.900
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:48.000 --> 00:23:52.780
While I was feeling miserable thanks to Ple,
someone even more miserable showed up.

00:23:52.780 --> 00:23:57.110
He's been struggling in the desert for ages,
 and his dream is to defeat a Gundam!

00:23:57.110 --> 00:23:59.820
They're seriously trying
to pull off something unreal,

00:23:59.820 --> 00:24:01.780
so it causes us a series of crises!

00:24:01.780 --> 00:24:04.200
The enemy's teamwork is tops!

00:24:04.200 --> 00:24:08.170
Next time on Gundam ZZ:
"The Face of Rommel."

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:08.870
Next Time

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:08.870
THE FACE OF ROMMEL

00:24:08.710 --> 00:24:11.130
It's not my story,
but it still makes me cry!
